@startuml
title 후보 A — Pair-Direct DMA-BUF Pipeline
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "비신뢰 Host" #FDE2E2 {
  component "Host Linux\npayload 접근 없음" as AHost
}

package "Camera pVM — pair exporter" #E8F5E9 {
  component "A-01\nCamera Frame Producer" as AProducer
  component "A-02\nPair Buffer Allocator /\nDMA-BUF Exporter" as AExporter
  component "A-03\nCamera Channel Adapter" as ACamAdapter
}

package "pKVM EL2 — pair-local connector" #E3F2FD {
  component "A-04\nDirect Pair Bridge\nhandle·global ref·fence" as ABridge
  component "A-05\nShared Page Mapping Adapter\nHost 비매핑·forced detach" as AMapper
}

package "AI pVM — pair importer" #E8F5E9 {
  component "A-06\nAI DMA-BUF Proxy Importer" as AImporter
  component "A-07\nAI Frame Consumer" as AConsumer
}

package "보호 HW·메모리" #FFF3CD {
  component "Camera HW" as ACamHW
  database "Pair backing page\n수명 정책: Camera exporter" as APage
  component "AI HW" as AAIHW
}

AProducer -[#1565C0]-> AExporter : 제어: buffer 요청
AExporter -[#1565C0]-> ACamAdapter : local dma-buf
AExporter -[#1565C0]-> APage : backing 할당·최종 해제
ACamAdapter -[#1565C0]-> ABridge : 제어: pair handle·ref·fence
ABridge -[#1565C0]-> AMapper : 제어: initial map / final unmap
AMapper -[#1565C0]-> APage : 보호 mapping 설정
ABridge -[#1565C0]-> AImporter : 제어: handle·fence relay
AImporter -[#1565C0]-> AConsumer : local proxy dma-buf
AProducer -[#1565C0]-> ACamHW : capture submit
ACamHW -[#2E7D32,bold]-> APage : payload: DMA write
APage -[#2E7D32,bold]-> AAIHW : payload: same-page DMA read
AConsumer -[#1565C0]-> AAIHW : AI submit after fence
AHost -[#C62828,dashed]-> APage : 금지: Host mapping

note bottom of ABridge
  Pipe connector = protected handle + reference + fence
  frame별 소유권/권한 상태 머신 없음
  장애 영향 범위 = Camera–AI pair
end note

legend bottom
  파란 실선: control·metadata / 초록 굵은선: payload / 빨간 점선: 금지 접근
endlegend
@enduml
